1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,933
Found the good stuff! Bleach and
ammonia. Double strength floors, baby!

2
00:00:04,433 --> 00:00:10,067
Sam! Put it down! Rule five. Never mix
cleaners. Bleach and ammonia make a
poison gas.

3
00:00:10,567 --> 00:00:15,267
Only one splash meets the other. It's
enough. Your throat burns. You crawl
to the door.

4
00:00:15,767 --> 00:00:17,467
One puff. One left.

5
00:00:17,967 --> 00:00:20,000
I'm so sorry. I almost killed you with
a mop.
